    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "key": "b2",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "E202 Potassium sorbate is the potassium salt of sorbic acid. It is used to inhibit the growth of moulds, yeasts, and fungi."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "key": "b3",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Why it is in your food"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "key": "b4",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Manufacturers use it as preservative."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "key": "b5",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "What we hold on it"
        }
      ]
    },
